    "text": "The trace of a square matrix is defined to be the sum of its diagonal entries. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;matrix such that the trace of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and the trace of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math> then the value of the determinant of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is_____",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
